<p style="margin:0pt 0 8pt 0;text-align:justify;margin-left:18pt;text-indent:18pt">         AND WHEREAS the VENDORS No.1 to 7, and certain others had various disputes, pending before the Honorable courts, the said disputes have been finally settled due to the intervention of the family elders and well-wishers, and accordingly all the parties entered into a Memorandum of compromise dated 14.08.2020 and the same has been filed in <b>A.S.No.552 of 2009 </b>before the Honorable High Court of Telangana, in accordance with the said compromise, the Honorable High court of Telangana passed the judgment on 23.08.2020. Thus, the Vendors 1 to 7, have become the absolute owners, to an extent of Ac.17.07 guntas, in <b>Survey Nos.127, 128, 129,130,133,134,145,147,148, and 149. </b></p>
<p style="margin:0pt 0 8pt 0;text-align:justify;margin-left:18pt;text-indent:5pt">AND whereas, during the life-time, of one Sri. Satyanarayana Singh, S/o. Late Tukaram Singh, who is the father of VENDOR No.s 1 to 4, had executed a deed of exchange, vide <b>Registered Document No.9130 of 2004,</b> dated 29.11.2004, to an extent of <b>Ac. 0.15.5 Gts., </b>in <b>Survey No.127</b> of Pupalguda Village, and in exchange, Sri. Satyanarayana Singh, S/o. Late Tukaram Singh, acquired <b>Ac.0.15.5 Gts</b>, in <b>Survey No.128/1</b>. Through this exchange, the net land of the family remained same and the family have acquired right over the said exchanged land of Ac.0.15.5 Gts., and gave in exchange Ac.0.15.5 Gts. in Sy.No.127. Thus, the Survey No. 128/1 has been included to an extent of Ac.0.15.5 guntas in accordance with the exchange deed.</p>
<p style="margin:0pt 0 8pt 0;text-align:justify;margin-left:18pt;text-indent:18pt">AND WHEREAS the VENDOR No.1( Sri.Ravi Singh), being the owner of yet another  extent of <b>Ac.0.21 Guntas</b> of land in <b>Survey No. 130/A/1 and 145/1</b> in Puppalguda Village, having executed yet another <b>Development Agreement Cum General Power of Attorney, bearing Document No.555/2022,</b> dated 09.11.2022, registered before the Tahsildar and Joint-Sub registrar, Gandipet Mandal, Ranga Reddy District, in favor of the Developer, herein;</p>
