<p style="margin:0pt 0 8pt 0;text-align:justify;margin-left:18pt;text-indent:18pt">AND WHEREAS, all the above names owners being OWNER No.s 1 to 12 having joined together their respective lands, forming a total extent Ac.18.04 Guntas, equivalent to <b>87595.11 Sq.yards</b>,  or <b>73,240.67 Sq. Meters</b> and having given the same for being developed into a Multi-storied, Residential Apartments Project to their GPA holder, namely M/s Ananda Homes, represented by its Managing Partner Sri P V Sreenivasulu, as shown hereinbelow.</p>
