<p style="margin:0pt 0 8pt 0;text-align:justify;margin-left:36pt;text-indent:-22.5pt"><span style="display:inline-block;width:22.5pt;text-indent:0">5.</span><b>VENDOR No.5 (Sri. Arjun Singh),</b> had executed 2(two) Development Agreements cum GENERAL POWER OF ATTORNEY’s,<b> 1. Development Agreement cum GENERAL POWER OF ATTORNEY </b>dated:04.08.2021, before the Tahsildar and Joint Sub-registrar, Gandipet Mandal, Ranga Reddy District, bearing <b>Document No.130/2021,</b> to an extent of <b>Ac.1.09 guntas, </b>in <b>Survey No. 147/AA/3, 148/AA/2 &amp; 149/5</b> 2.<b> Development Agreement cum General Power of Attorney </b>dated 16.06.2023,<b> </b>before the Sub-registrar, Gandipet, Ranga Reddy, <b>document bearing No.13661 of 2023,</b> along with his one  son, and three daughters, as consenting parties, in favor of the Developer,  herein, to an extent of <b>2783 Sq.yards (Ac.0.23Gts.)</b> in <b>Survey No.130/AA/2,</b> and <b>Survey No.145/1/1/1/2,</b> to a total extent admeasuring <b>Ac.1.32 guntas, </b>and same was converted by NALA Proceedings No.2300787663, Dated:16/10/2023, Dharani Pattadar Pass Book No.T05070070213,Khata No.60190.</p>
<p style="margin:0">&#160;</p>
<p style="margin:0pt 0 8pt 0;text-align:justify;margin-left:36pt;text-indent:-22.5pt"><span style="display:inline-block;width:22.5pt;text-indent:0">6.</span><b>VENDOR No.6 (Sri. K Suresh &#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;Singh), </b>had executed two (2) Development Agreements cum GENERAL POWER OF ATTORNEY’s<b>,</b> 1<b>. Development Agreement cum General Power of Attorney,</b> Dated:04.08.2021, before the Tahsildar and Joint Sub-registrar, Gandipet Mandal, Ranga Reddy District, bearing <b>Document No.131/2021, </b>to an extent of<b> Ac.1.09 guntas, in Survey Nos. 147/E/1, 148/AA/3, 148/E/1 &amp; 149/6</b> 2. <b>Development Agreement cum General Power of Attorney,</b> Dated: 16.06.2023, before the  Sub-registrar, Gandipet, Ranga Reddy District, bearing <b>Document No.9017/2023, </b>to an extent of<b> Ac.0.23 guntas, </b>in<b> Survey No. 130/AA/3, 130/E/1 &amp; 145/1/1/1/1/1/2,</b> along with his Two sons, as consenting parties, in favor of the Developer herein, to an total extent of <b>Ac.1.32 guntas, </b>and the same was converted by NALA Proceedings No.2300512242, Dated:11/07/2023, Dharani Pattadar Pass Book No.T05070070208,Khata No.60196.</p>
<p style="margin:0">&#160;</p>
