<p style="margin:0">&#160;</p>
<p style="margin:0pt 0 8pt 0;text-align:justify;margin-left:40.5pt;text-indent:-22.5pt"><span style="display:inline-block;width:22.5pt;text-indent:0">8.</span><b>VENDOR No.8 (Sri.D.Vishwajeet Reddy Alias Devalapalli Vishwajeet Reddy)</b> executed <b>Development Agreement cum General Power of Attorney</b> in favor of the Developer, and the same is registered as <b>Document No.453 of 2023, </b>dated: 07.11.2023, before the  Tahsildar and Joint Sub-registrar, Gandipet Mandal, Ranga Reddy District, an total extent of <b>Ac.0.21 guntas, </b>and the same was converted under NALA proceedings No.2300851966, Dated:02/12/2023, Dharani Pattadar Pass Book No.T05070070387, Khata No.60410.</p>
<p style="margin:0">&#160;</p>
<p style="margin:0pt 0 8pt 0;text-align:justify;margin-left:36pt;text-indent:-22.5pt"><span style="display:inline-block;width:22.5pt;text-indent:0">9.</span><b>VENDOR No.9 (Smt.Devallapalli Srinitya Reddy)</b> and executed <b>Development Agreement cum General Power of Attorney</b> in favor of the Developer, and the same is registered as <b>Document No.454 of 2023,</b> dated: 07.11.2023, before the Tahsildar and Joint Sub-registrar, Gandipet Mandal, Ranga Reddy District, total admeasuring an extent of <b>Ac.0.20 guntas, </b>and converted the land under NALA Proceedings No.2300855121, Dated:06/12/2023, Dharani Pattadar Pass Book No. T05070070386, Khata No.60409.</p>
<p style="margin:0">&#160;</p>
<p style="margin:0pt 0 8pt 0;text-align:justify;margin-left:36pt;text-indent:-22.5pt"><span style="display:inline-block;width:22.5pt;text-indent:0">10.</span><b> VENDOR No.10(Sri. Shenolikar Dinanath),</b> executed a <b>Development Agreement cum General Power of Attorney</b> in favor of the Developer, herein and the same is registered as <b>Document No.455 of 2023, </b>dated:07.11.2023, before the Tahsildar and Joint Sub-registrar, Gandipet Mandal, Ranga Reddy District, an extent of <b>Ac.0.02 guntas </b>and converted the land under NALA Proceedings No. 2300843580, Dated 20.11.2023, Dharani Pattadar Pass Book No. T05070070385, Khata No.60408.</p>
<p style="margin:0">&#160;</p>
<p style="margin:0pt 0 8pt 0;text-align:justify;margin-left:36pt;text-indent:-22.5pt"><span style="display:inline-block;width:22.5pt;text-indent:0">11.</span><b>VENDOR No.11 (M/s. MEDHINI LIFESPACES LLP)</b>, represented by its Managing Partner, Sri.  TSSSVVHV Prasad, S/o. Late Satyanarayana Thota,  executed a <b>Development Agreement cum General Power of Attorney</b> in favor of the Developer, herein and the same is registered as <b>Document No.15527 of 2023, </b>dated:19.12.2023, Registered at office of the Sub-registrar office, Gandipet Mandal, Ranga Reddy District extent of <b>Ac.0.39 guntas </b>and converted the same under NALA Proceedings No.2300852611, Dated:04/12/2023, Dharani Pattadar Pass Book No.T05070070384, Khata No. 60407. Subsequently, to the development agreement  a <b>Rectification Deed Cum General Power Of Attorney</b>, vide <b>Doct.No.15856/2023</b>, Dated:23/12/2023, Registered at office of the Sub-registrar office, Gandipet Mandal, Ranga Reddy District was executed correcting the extent of land in <b>Survey No.130/A/2, </b>to an extent of Ac.0.07 Gts, <b>130/A/3/1</b> to an extent of Ac.0.05 Gts<b>, </b>in<b> Survey No. 145/1/1/1/1/2 </b>to an extent of Ac.0.14 Gts, in <b>Survey No.145/2</b> to an extent of Ac.0.13 Gts,<b> </b>total<b> </b> extent of land of <b>4719 Square Yards</b> (Ac.0.39 guntas), situated at <b>PUPPALGUDA VILLAGE,</b> Gandipet Mandal, Ranga Reddy District, Telangana State. Thus, the same has been converted the land under NALA proceedings No.2300852614, Dated:04/12/2023, Dharani Pattadar Pass Book No. T05070070253, Khata No.60224. </p>
<p style="margin:0">&#160;</p>
<p style="margin:0pt 0 8pt 0;text-align:justify;margin-left:36pt;text-indent:-22.5pt"><span style="display:inline-block;width:22.5pt;text-indent:0">12.</span><b>VENDOR No.12 (M/s. ANANDA HOMES)</b> who is also the Developer, herein, represented by its Managing Partner, Sri. P.V. Sreenivasulu, S/o. Late Sri. P.C.V. Ramanaiah,.</p>
<p style="margin:0pt 0 8pt 0;text-align:justify">Whereas, Vendors No.1 to 7, have entered into separate registered supplementary agreements, have divided their respective shares and the entire remaining area has gone to the share of the developer and Vendors No.8 to 11, have divided their shares by Flat Nos. as mentioned in their respective Development cum General Power of Attorney Agreements, and left the remaining area to the Developer, herein, demarcating their shares, as shown hereinbelow: </p>
<p style="margin:0pt 0 8pt 0;text-align:justify;margin-left:36pt;text-indent:-22.5pt"><span style="display:inline-block;width:22.5pt;text-indent:0">1.</span><b>VENDOR No.1 (Sri. Ravi Singh),</b> herein has entered into a Supplementary Agreement with the Developer viz., M/s. Ananda Homes, vide <b>Registered Supplementary Agreement, vide Document No.14267/2023,</b> Book-I, Dated:06/11/2023, registered at Sub Registrar office, Gandipet, Ranga Reddy District, Telangana State</p>
<p style="margin:0">&#160;</p>
<p style="margin:0pt 0 8pt 0;text-align:justify;margin-left:36pt;text-indent:-22.5pt"><span style="display:inline-block;width:22.5pt;text-indent:0">2.</span><b>Vendor No.2 (Sri.Magan Singh)</b> herein has entered into a Supplementary Agreement with the Developer viz., M/s. Ananda Homes, vide <b>Registered Supplementary Agreement, vide Document No.13649/2023,</b> Book-I, Dated:03/11/2023, registered at Sub Registrar office, Gandipet, Ranga Reddy District, Telangana State.</p>
<p style="margin:0">&#160;</p>
<p style="margin:0pt 0 8pt 0;text-align:justify;margin-left:36pt;text-indent:-22.5pt"><span style="display:inline-block;width:22.5pt;text-indent:0">3.</span><b>Vendor No.3 (Sri.Sardar Singh)</b> herein has entered into a Supplementary Agreement with the Developer viz., M/s. Ananda Homes, vide <b>Registered Supplementary Agreement, vide Document No.14269/2023,</b> Book-I, Dated:06/11/2023, registered at Sub Registrar office, Gandipet, Ranga Reddy District, Telangana State.</p>
<p style="margin:0">&#160;</p>
<p style="margin:0pt 0 8pt 0;text-align:justify;margin-left:36pt;text-indent:-22.5pt"><span style="display:inline-block;width:22.5pt;text-indent:0">4.</span><b>Vendor No.4 (Sri. Rajkumar Singh)</b> herein has entered into a Supplementary Agreement with the Developer viz., M/s. Ananda Homes, vide <b>Registered Supplementary Agreement, vide Document No.14268/2023,</b> Book-I, Dated:06/11/2023, registered at Sub Registrar office, Gandipet, Ranga Reddy District, Telangana State.</p>
<p style="margin:0">&#160;</p>
<p style="margin:0pt 0 8pt 0;text-align:justify;margin-left:36pt;text-indent:-22.5pt"><span style="display:inline-block;width:22.5pt;text-indent:0">5.</span><b>Vendor No.5 (Sri. Arjun Singh)</b> herein has entered into a Supplementary Agreement with the Developer viz., M/s. Ananda Homes, vide <b>Registered Supplementary Agreement, vide Document No.16080/2023,</b> Book-I, Dated:28/12/2023, registered at Sub Registrar office, Gandipet, Ranga Reddy District, Telangana State.</p>
<p style="margin:0">&#160;</p>
<p style="margin:0pt 0 8pt 0;text-align:justify;margin-left:36pt;text-indent:-22.5pt"><span style="display:inline-block;width:22.5pt;text-indent:0">6.</span><b>VENDOR No.6 (Sri.K.Suresh Singh)</b> herein has entered into a Supplementary Agreement with the Developer viz., M/s. Ananda Homes, vide <b>Registered Supplementary Agreement, vide Document No.16081/2023,</b> Book-I, Dated:29/12/2023, registered at Sub Registrar office, Gandipet, Ranga Reddy District, Telangana State.</p>
<p style="margin:0">&#160;</p>
<p style="margin:0pt 0 8pt 0;text-align:justify;margin-left:36pt;text-indent:-22.5pt"><span style="display:inline-block;width:22.5pt;text-indent:0">7.</span><b>VENDOR No.7 (Sri.K.Sudheer Singh)</b> herein has entered into a Supplementary Agreement with the Developer viz., M/s. Ananda Homes, vide <b>Registered Supplementary Agreement, vide Document No.16082/2023,</b> Book-I, Dated:29/12/2023, registered at Sub Registrar office, Gandipet, Ranga Reddy District, Telangana State.</p>
<p style="margin:0pt 0 8pt 0;text-align:justify">AND WHEREAS in so far as the Vendors No.8 to 11 are concerned, the areas and their flats, have been clearly allotted in the development agreements themselves, executed by them, respectively, and therefore no separate supplementary agreements were entered by the Vendors No.8 to 11. </p>
<p style="margin:0pt 0 8pt 0;text-align:justify">AND WHEREAS the Developer herein, having obtained a building permission for 11 (eleven)Blocks, with 3 Basements, and Ground Floor, and 22 Upper Floors, 12th Block with 3 Cellars, Ground Floor and 5 Upper Floors, Amenities Block-I, 3 Cellars and Ground Floor, 4 Upper Floors, and Amenities Block-II, with 3 Cellars, Ground Floor and 3 Upper Floors,  vide <b>Permission No. 01722/SKP/Plg/HMDA/2022</b> dated:25/06/2024, in <b>Survey Nos. 128/P, 129, 130/P, 145, 147, 147/P, 148 and 149, </b>situated at Puppalguda Village, Gandipet Mandal, Ranga Reddy District, Telangana State, in an extent of <b>73240.67 Sq .meters</b>, equivalent<b> 87595.11 Sq.yards</b>,   (Ac.18.04 Gts.)</p>
<p style="margin:0pt 0 8pt 0;text-align:justify">In the process of getting the above HMDA permissions, an area to the extent of <b>5761.65 Sq. Meters</b> equivalent to <b>6890.88 Square Yards</b>, out of the entire extent of <b>73240.67 Sq. Meters</b> equivalent to <b>87595.11 Sq. Yards</b> is gifted for widening of Road, which is registered in favor of The Commissioner, Manikonda Municipality vide Registered <b>Gift Deed Document No: 16083/2023 Dated 29-12-2023 </b>registered at S.R.O., Gandipet. Hence, M/s. Ananda Homes &amp; Others is developing the project in the extent of 67479.02 Sq. Meters Equivalent to 80704.23 Sq. Yards (after adjusting the area under road widening and considering the physical availability) referred to as the Total Property and is described in details in the Schedule A hereto.</p>
<p style="margin:0pt 0 8pt 0;text-align:justify">AND WHEREAS other than the flats which are clearly allotted/demarcated, under the Supplementary agreements, and the development agreements respectively, all other flats, remain with the Vendor No.12, being the developer, herein. </p>
<p style="margin:0pt 0 8pt 0;text-align:justify">AND WHEREAS the developer is fully competent to enter into this agreement and all the legal formalities with respect to the right, title and interest of the developer has been completed.</p>
<p style="margin:0pt 0 8pt 0;text-align:justify">AND WHEREAS, The Developer had registered the Project THE LEGACEY for 11 (eleven) Blocks, with 3 Basements, and Ground Floor, and 22 Upper Floors, 12th Block with 3 Cellars, Ground Floor and 5 Upper Floors, Amenities Block-I, 3 Cellars and Ground Floor, 4 Upper Floors, and Amenities Block-II, with 3 Cellars, Ground Floor and 3 Upper Floors,   under the provisions of the Act with the <b>Telangana Real Estate Regulatory Authority(TSRERA)</b> at Hyderabad and has been granted <b>registration No. P02400008615,</b> dated:07/08/2024.</p>
<p style="margin:0pt 0 0pt 0;text-align:justify">Whereas Developer have thus acquired the total extent of Ac. 18.04 Gts or 73240.67 sq. meters in Survey Nos. 128/P, 129, 130/P, 145, 147, 147/P, 148 and 149, Situated at Puppalguda Village, Gandipet Mandal, Ranga Reddy District, Telangana State more particularly described in the Schedule-A annexed hereto and hereinafter called the “Schedule-A” and obtained permission from Hyderabad Metropolitan Development Authority for 11 (eleven)Blocks, with 3 Basements, and Ground Floor, and 22 Upper Floors, 12th Block with 3 Cellars, Ground Floor and 5 Upper Floors, Amenities Block-I, 3 Cellars and Ground Floor, 4 Upper Floors, and Amenities Block-II, with 3 Cellars, Ground Floor and 3 Upper Floors,  vide Permission No. 01722/SKP/Plg/HMDA/2022 dated:25/06/2024 and in the process of acquiring permissions for two Additional TDR floors i.e 23rd and 24th Floors over and above the approved G+22 Floors.</p>
<p style="margin:0">&#160;</p>
<p style="margin:0pt 0 0pt 0;text-align:justify">Whereas the Vendee was clearly informed and acknowledges that the Developer has applied for permission to construct two additional floors, i.e., the 23rd and 24th floors, above the sanctioned Ground + 22 floors, by utilizing Transferable Development Rights (TDR) purchased by the Developer.</p>
<p style="margin:0">&#160;</p>
<p style="margin:0pt 0 0pt 0;text-align:justify">The Vendee agrees that the said additional floors (23rd and 24th floors), shall be the exclusive property of the Developer, and the Vendee shall have no right, title, interest, or claim of any nature whatsoever in respect thereof.</p>
<p style="margin:0">&#160;</p>
<p style="margin:0pt 0 0pt 0;text-align:justify">The Vendee further has no objection to the allocation and distribution of the proportionate undivided share of land among the purchasers/owners of the sanctioned Ground + 22 floors, as may be finalized upon approval of the revised plan by the competent authority.</p>
<p style="margin:0">&#160;</p>
<p style="margin:0pt 0 0pt 0;text-align:justify">The Vendee undertakes to sign and furnish all documents required by competent authorities, for obtaining approvals, sanctions, for the said additional floors, without objection to the developer.</p>
<p style="margin:0">&#160;</p>
<p style="margin:0pt 0 8pt 0;text-align:justify">AND WHEREAS, The Developer had obtained the sanctioned building plan, specifications and approvals for the Project including Tower {!selectedTowerName} from HMDA, Hyderabad. </p>
<p style="margin:0pt 0 8pt 0;text-align:justify">AND WHEREAS, The Developer agrees and undertakes that it shall not make any changes to these approved plans except in strict compliance with S.14 of the Act, other laws as applicable and as agreed under this Agreement.</p>
<p style="margin:0pt 0 8pt 0;text-align:justify">AND WHEREAS, <b>Flat No. {!selectedFlatLabel} </b>in <b>Tower No. {!selectedTowerName}</b>, admeasuring an extent of <b><apex:outputText value="{0,number,0.##}"><apex:param value="{!selectedUnit.Saleable_Area_Sft__c}"/></apex:outputText> Sft,</b> is falling to the share of the Developer and accordingly, the Vendors herein have agreed to sell and the Vendee, agreed to purchase the said flat for a total consideration of <b>Rs. {!formattedTotalFlatCost}/- ({!agreementAmountInWords})</b></p>
<p style="margin:0pt 0 8pt 0;text-align:justify">AND WHEREAS, The VENDEE/S having verified the title and having satisfied himself/herself/themselves/itself about their right and ownership and the authority of DEVELOPER to develop the Schedule Property, has/have applied for in the Project vide RERA registration number referred in above, <b>Flat No. {!selectedFlatLabel}, Tower No. {!selectedTowerName},</b> in the Project under this sale agreement has fallen to the share of the developer. </p>
<p style="margin:0pt 0 8pt 0;text-align:justify">AND WHEREAS, The Parties have gone through all the terms and conditions set out in this Agreement and understood the mutual rights and obligations detailed herein.</p>
<p style="margin:0pt 0 8pt 0;text-align:justify">AND WHEREAS, The Developer has fully disclosed all facts relating to their right, title and interest in respect of the Schedule Property and this agreement constitutes and represents the entire agreement between the parties and cancels and supersedes all prior arrangements, agreements or understandings, negotiations and discussions, if any; whether oral or writing, between the parties on the subject matter hereof, or in respect of any matters dealt with herein and on such basis, the Vendee has/have accepted and unconditionally agreed and entered this Agreement of Sale with free will and consent and without any coercion or whatsoever;</p>
<p style="margin:0pt 0 8pt 0;text-align:justify">AND WHEREAS, The Parties hereby confirm that they are signing this Agreement with full knowledge of all the laws, rules, regulations, notifications, etc. applicable to the Project;</p>
<p style="margin:0pt 0 8pt 0;text-align:justify">AND WHEREAS, The Parties, relying on the confirmations, representations and assurances of each other to faithfully abide by all the terms, conditions and stipulations contained in this Agreement and all applicable laws, are now willing to enter into this Agreement on the terms and conditions appearing hereinafter,</p>
<p style="margin:0pt 0 8pt 0;text-align:justify">AND WHEREAS, In accordance with the terms and conditions set out in this Agreement and as mutually agreed upon by and between the Parties, the DEVELOPER hereby agrees to sell and the VENDEE/S hereby agree to purchase the Flat Which is more specifically demarcated as per the Schedule below.</p>
<p style="margin:0">&#160;</p>
