.</p></td></tr><tr><td style="border:0.5px solid #000;padding:3pt 5pt;vertical-align:top;width:27.0%;height:26.05pt;"><p style="margin:0pt 0 0pt 0;text-align:left">Windows</p></td><td style="border:0.5px solid #000;padding:3pt 5pt;vertical-align:top;width:73.0%;height:26.05pt;"><p style="margin:0pt 0 0pt 0;text-align:left">UPVC for all windows with clear glass and Safety Grills for Windows.</p></td></tr><tr><td style="border:0.5px solid #000;padding:3pt 5pt;vertical-align:top;width:27.0%;height:35.1pt;"><p style="margin:0pt 0 0pt 0;text-align:left">Painting</p></td><td style="border:0.5px solid #000;padding:3pt 5pt;vertical-align:top;width:73.0%;height:35.1pt;"><p style="margin:0pt 0 0pt 0;text-align:left">External: Texture/Two coats of acrylic exterior paint/ weather shield paint.<br/>Internal: Two coats of emulsion paint over the putty-finished/ primer-coated surface.</p></td></tr><tr><td style="border:0.5px solid #000;padding:3pt 5pt;vertical-align:top;width:27.0%;height:29.5pt;"><p style="margin:0pt 0 0pt 0;text-align:left">Gas Pipe line</p></td><td style="border:0.5px solid #000;padding:3pt 5pt;vertical-align:top;width:73.0%;height:29.5pt;"><p style="margin:0pt 0 0pt 0;text-align:left">Centralized piped gas to all ﬂats through digital/prepaid meters with ISI standards.</p></td></tr><tr><td style="border:0.5px solid #000;padding:3pt 5pt;vertical-align:top;width:27.0%;"><p style="margin:0pt 0 0pt 0;text-align:left">Plumbing</p></td><td style="border:0.5px solid #000;padding:3pt 5pt;vertical-align:top;width:73.0%;"><p style="margin:0pt 0 0pt 0;text-align:left">Concealed best quality PVC/CPVC pipes.</p></td></tr><tr><td style="border:0.5px solid #000;padding:3pt 5pt;vertical-align:top;width:27.0%;height:40.8pt;"><p style="margin:0pt 0 0pt 0;text-align:left">CP Fittings &amp; Sanitary Ware</p></td><td style="border:0.5px solid #000;padding:3pt 5pt;vertical-align:top;width:73.0%;height:40.8pt;"><p style="margin:0pt 0 0pt 0;text-align:left">Toto/ Delta/ Roca/ Schell or equivalent makes will be provided for all toilets.</p></td></tr><tr><td style="border:0.5px solid #000;padding:3pt 5pt;vertical-align:top;width:27.0%;height:169.6pt;"><p style="margin:0pt 0 0pt 0;text-align:left">Electrical &amp; Communication</p></td><td style="border:0.5px solid #000;padding:3pt 5pt;vertical-align:top;width:73.0%;height:169.6pt;"><p style="margin:0pt 0 0pt 0;text-align:left">Concealed copper wiring in conduits for lights, fans, power plugs etc. HPL/RR/KEI or equivalent make.<br/><br/>a. PVC Conduits of Sudhakar or equivalent make.<br/>b. Modular Switches of Le Grand or equivalent make.<br/>c. TV Provision in all bed rooms and living area with DTH connectivity provision.<br/>d .Broadband connectivity to all bed rooms &amp; living area<br/>e. Power points in living, dining and all bedrooms.<br/>f. Geyser points in all toilets.<br/>g. Power provisions in kitchen. </p></td></tr><tr><td style="border:0.5px solid #000;padding:3pt 5pt;vertical-align:top;width:27.0%;height:25.05pt;"><p style="margin:0pt 0 0pt 0;text-align:left">Fire Fighting</p></td><td style="border:0.5px solid #000;padding:3pt 5pt;vertical-align:top;width:73.0%;height:25.05pt;"><p style="margin:0pt 0 0pt 0;text-align:left">Provision of Fire Fighting System at Common Area &amp; Fire Sprinklers at Every Room of each Flat.</p></td></tr><tr><td style="border:0.5px solid #000;padding:3pt 5pt;vertical-align:top;width:27.0%;height:68.65pt;"><p style="margin:0pt 0 0pt 0;text-align:left">Security Network</p></td><td style="border:0.5px solid #000;padding:3pt 5pt;vertical-align:top;width:73.0%;height:68.65pt;"><p style="margin:0pt 0 0pt 0;text-align:left">a. CC TV cameras are placed at each block’s, main entrance, common areas and club house with monitoring and recording from security room<br/>b. Boom barriers with long range readers at entry and exit for tenant's unobstructed movement<br/>c. Solar powered security fence on compound wall</p></td></tr><tr><td style="border:0.5px solid #000;padding:3pt 5pt;vertical-align:top;width:27.0%;"><p style="margin:0pt 0 0pt 0;text-align:left">Lifts</p></td><td style="border:0.5px solid #000;padding:3pt 5pt;vertical-align:top;width:73.0%;"><p style="margin:0pt 0 0pt 0;text-align:left">Mitsubishi /Johnson / Kone or Equivalent make LIG provided with automatic door.</p></td></tr><tr><td style="border:0.5px solid #000;padding:3pt 5pt;vertical-align:top;width:27.0%;height:40pt;"><p style="margin:0pt 0 0pt 0;text-align:left">Rain Water</p></td><td style="border:0.5px solid #000;padding:3pt 5pt;vertical-align:top;width:73.0%;height:40pt;"><p style="margin:0pt 0 0pt 0;text-align:left">The rain water from the terrace and open area will be collected through rainwater pipes, which will be discharged into the rain water harvesting pits to recharge the underground water level.</p></td></tr><tr><td style="border:0.5px solid #000;padding:3pt 5pt;vertical-align:top;width:27.0%;"><p style="margin:0pt 0 0pt 0;text-align:left">Water Supply</p></td><td style="border:0.5px solid #000;padding:3pt 5pt;vertical-align:top;width:73.0%;"><p style="margin:0pt 0 0pt 0;text-align:left">Provision for Municipal Water</p></td></tr><tr><td style="border:0.5px solid #000;padding:3pt 5pt;vertical-align:top;width:27.0%;height:35pt;"><p style="margin:0pt 0 0pt 0;text-align:left">STP</p></td><td style="border:0.5px solid #000;padding:3pt 5pt;vertical-align:top;width:73.0%;height:35pt;"><p style="margin:0pt 0 0pt 0;text-align:left">Sewage Treatment Plant of adequate capacity as per norms will be provided inside the project. Treated sewage will be used for landscaping and flushing.</p></td></tr><tr><td style="border:0.5px solid #000;padding:3pt 5pt;vertical-align:top;width:27.0%;height:37pt;"><p style="margin:0pt 0 0pt 0;text-align:left">Generator</p></td><td style="border:0.5px solid #000;padding:3pt 5pt;vertical-align:top;width:73.0%;height:37pt;"><p style="margin:0pt 0 0pt 0;text-align:left">A reputed sound proof generator will provide 100% power backup for common areas, as well as Light &amp; Fan points in the hall, bedrooms &amp; Kitchen.</p></td></tr></table>
